Package: riscos-firmware-cards
Architecture: all
Maintainer: Andrew Youll <adyoull@users.noreply.github.com>
Depends: riscos-firmware
Section: non-free-firmware/kernel
Priority: optional
Homepage: https://github.com/adyoull/riscos-rolpkg
Description: Firmware for fitted Wi-Fi and network cards, for RISC OS on Linux
 The firmware files the riscos-kernel-generic and riscos-kernel-wdk2023
 drivers for cards inside a machine ask for: PCI Express and SDIO Wi-Fi
 (Intel, Realtek, MediaTek, Qualcomm Atheros, including the Windows Dev
 Kit 2023's) and network cards that need one. From linux-firmware; each
 maker's licence is in /usr/lib/firmware/LICENSES, and WHENCE there says
 which file is whose.
